OL,3,ABurnham had two hospitality dinners
OL,4,Awith Man City chairman, deleted records
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham had two hospitality
OL,8,Fdinners with Manchester City football
OL,9,Fclub's chairman while mayor of Greater
OL,10,FManchester, it has emerged.
OL,12,FThe PM dined with Khaldoon Al Mubarak
OL,13,Fat matches in 2017 and 2018 - but this
OL,14,Fwas not detailed in a statement on
OL,15,FMonday by the Greater Manchester
OL,16,FCombined Authority (GMCA) about his
OL,17,Fmeetings with the club.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
