OL,3,ABurnham had two hospitality dinners
OL,4,Awith Man City chairman, deleted records
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham has been under pressure to
OL,8,Fclarify his previous discussions with
OL,9,FMan City since the club was found
OL,10,Fguilty of having "systematically"
OL,11,Fbroken Premier League rules, which it
OL,12,Fwill appeal.
OL,14,FThe PM, who was mayor until June,
OL,15,Fsparked widespread controversy when he
OL,16,Fsaid last month he would be "really
OL,17,Fconcerned" if the club's owners now
OL,18,Fsold up.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
